  "name": "ts-record-sort-200k",
  "description": "FIG-7428: build 200,000 {id,key} records, then comparator sort. Independent Rust oracles consume every key in five bounded chunks after each compute cell. Full geometry for manual and scheduled measurement; no wall-time gate.",
